# Anchored to repo root: unanchored `lib/`/`lib64/` also matched
# frontend/src/lib/, silently excluding it (and auth.ts) from every commit
# since the initial commit — the frontend was never buildable from a clean
# clone as a result. These are Python packaging build directories, not
# meant to reach into frontend/.
/build/
develop-eggs/
dist/
downloads/
eggs/
.eggs/
/lib/
/lib64/
parts/
sdist/
var/
